# SwarmLedger: Cryptographic Merkle DAG & Causal Provenance Ledger

SwarmLedger is Stage 5 of the Swarm Suite Agent Hypervisor stack. It provides tamper-evident write-ahead Merkle DAG state, RFC 8785 canonical serialization, causal Lamport clocks, and attention distillation across all hypervisor primitives.
